7762185c3fd2cab933c6" :answer-field/choices ["q-82337/selection/mathematical-correction-units-v1/c1f97ed90f99d323d0e024ddd1af58673b0d077d16b8e57ce3fff3b093aeb1f5/f583d44249377d444a2366a2ac28ea4ca0711b051a9d7762185c3fd2cab933c6" "q-82337/selection/mathematical-correction-units-v1/c1f97ed90f99d323d0e024ddd1af58673b0d077d16b8e57ce3fff3b093aeb1f5/3a030a6f906825157a8308c474a14fb29def70a9ee93d6cce66db81b63432774" "q-82337/selection/mathematical-correction-units-v1/c1f97ed90f99d323d0e024ddd1af58673b0d077d16b8e57ce3fff3b093aeb1f5/d99e47350762385b2972f8918c0dd8c9d2684502d59789da9cea764af55bbeeb" "q-82337/selection/mathematical-correction-units-v1/c1f97ed90f99d323d0e024ddd1af58673b0d077d16b8e57ce3fff3b093aeb1f5/cc2eaf7cadd496edcad87c70fb896620656696b27819fbc426386d502af58dde" "q-82337/selection/mathematical-correction-units-v1/c1f97ed90f99d323d0e024ddd1af58673b0d077d16b8e57ce3fff3b093aeb1f5/f56396b11582d5853ad1a4bc248043cb96fd7199beae9042c770133b60ec3165"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186344884 :question/answer-fields 17592186344885] {:db/id 17592186344884 :db/ensure [:question/validate] :question/worked-solution "To compute the acceleration vector, we need to differentiate the velocity vector. So first, we need to compute the velocity vector, which we can do this by differentiating the position vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{4}{1+t}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{{t}^{3}}{3}-4t+5)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\frac{4}{(1+t)^{2}},\\,{t}^{2}-4⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to compute the acceleration vector, we differentiate the velocity vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-\\frac{4}{(1+t)^{2}}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{2}-4)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{8}{(1+t)^{3}},\\,2t⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the acceleration at time $t=1,$ we substitute $t=1$ into the above:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(1) & =⟨\\frac{8}{(1+(1))^{3}},\\,2(1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{8}{{2}^{3}},\\,2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, to find the magnitude of the acceleration, we compute $|a(1)|:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|a(1)| & =|⟨1,\\,2⟩| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(1)^{2}+(2)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{5}\\,\\text{m}/\\text{s}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/answer-fields ["q-82337/selection/mathematical-correction-units-v1/c1f97ed90f99d323d0e024ddd1af58673b0d077d16b8e57ce3fff3b093aeb1f5"]} {:db/id "q-82336/selection/mathematical-correction-units-v1/8189abdd7a06e3ac7c7e58233ddc4b5a7d2ca0fa5c7d3c6756615e20d58e5c1a/d8cb05b2cf15389807215b5cea4a4b19919ce1e8800952daf947f4578abaf9fc" :answer/id #uuid "07a22582-d5da-5212-915b-e3a199b49910" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6\\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{m}/\\text{s}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-82336/selection/mathematical-correction-units-v1/8189abdd7a06e3ac7c7e58233ddc4b5a7d2ca0fa5c7d3c6756615e20d58e5c1a/d8fa86582799e611561be108ca955eebf649ea8fb870a2b05cda3949db1b8f69" :answer/id #uuid "8416fb82-4e1a-52d9-a5e2-34c79336a68f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10\\,\\text{m}/\\text{s}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-82336/selection/mathematical-correction-units-v1/8189abdd7a06e3ac7c7e58233ddc4b5a7d2ca0fa5c7d3c6756615e20d58e5c1a/baf2449da24d4d20d4a3afa686a51dfaff3d0abd9c4656ede3d13a1b37135bc9" :answer/id #uuid "75470088-1730-5745-9cd8-b974912c8efd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8\\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{m}/\\text{s}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-82336/selection/mathematical-correction-units-v1/8189abdd7a06e3ac7c7e58233ddc4b5a7d2ca0fa5c7d3c6756615e20d58e5c1a/4417e908d15e6a350d27386726eda84b8ed4775387ec33b0b0913c99ab88fa5b" :answer/id #uuid "a9bb9b42-334a-59bd-b95e-d299449ac023" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12\\,\\text{m}/\\